    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through the stars in this high-octane platformer-shooter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the space suit of a fearless astronaut on a mission to stop an alien invasion threatening the galaxy. <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> combines fast-paced action, tight platforming, and explosive shootouts across a variety of dynamic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless-wave combat zones</strong> teeming with alien enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive boss battles</strong> that push your skills to the limit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon evolves automatically as you progress \u2014 unlocking <strong>three power stages</strong> that unleash devastating firepower just when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're dodging lasers, leaping over alien-infested gaps, or holding the line against impossible odds, <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> delivers an adrenaline-pumping experience that keeps you coming back for one more run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 2D platformer shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold sci-fi pixel art style and energetic soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the storm. Save the galaxy.</strong><br>Are you ready for the <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong>?</p>",
